{"4742960": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Wolfbane", "steam_appid": 4742960, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wolfbane is a dark fantasy werewolf action RPG set in a brutal medieval world cursed by blood, superstition, and the hunt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4742960/extras/125b99c3afed63928985cb18d2dc7a5f.avif?t=1780234285\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4742960/extras_big/125b99c3afed63928985cb18d2dc7a5f.avif?t=1780234285 width=1560 height=878 /></span>Play as a werewolf wandering through forests, ruined villages and ancient wilderness while uncovering the secrets behind the curse. Hunt enemies, explore the world, and grow stronger as both man and beast.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by dark fantasy worlds and werewolf folklore, Wolfbane focuses on atmosphere, immersion, exploration, and the feeling of becoming a powerful predator.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a werewolf in both human and beast forms</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore forests, ruined villages, castles and wilderness</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight medieval soldiers, hunters, monsters, and powerful boss enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new abilities and grow stronger over time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climbing and traversal mechanics inspired by open world adventure games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover lore through journals, books, and hidden fragments scattered across the world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric medieval world inspired by werewolf legends and folklore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blood, gore, dismemberment, and brutal melee combat</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wolfbane is a dark fantasy werewolf action RPG set in a brutal medieval world cursed by blood, superstition, and the hunt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4742960/extras/125b99c3afed63928985cb18d2dc7a5f.avif?t=1780234285\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4742960/extras_big/125b99c3afed63928985cb18d2dc7a5f.avif?t=1780234285 width=1560 height=878 /></span>Play as a werewolf wandering through forests, ruined villages and ancient wilderness while uncovering the secrets behind the curse. Hunt enemies, explore the world, and grow stronger as both man and beast.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by dark fantasy worlds and werewolf folklore, Wolfbane focuses on atmosphere, immersion, exploration, and the feeling of becoming a powerful predator.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a werewolf in both human and beast forms</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore forests, ruined villages, castles and wilderness</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight medieval soldiers, hunters, monsters, and powerful boss enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new abilities and grow stronger over time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climbing and traversal mechanics inspired by open world adventure games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover lore through journals, books, and hidden fragments scattered across the world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric medieval world inspired by werewolf legends and folklore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blood, gore, dismemberment, and brutal melee combat</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "A dark fantasy werewolf action RPG focused on exploration, hunting, and brutal melee combat. Hunt 